; The holy light a Skeleton Healer calls down, lying on the floor under whoever it is
; for until it lands -- the meteor's mark turned round, and a thing in the world for
; the same reasons. How long it lies and how much it gives back are the skill's: see
; the Q skill of the SkeletonHealer.
Projectile
  Name = MendingLight
  DisplayName = Holy Light
  VisionRange = 0
  Modules = [
    MendingUpdate
    End
  ]


; The light it calls down, lying on the floor until it lands. It lies still and long
; enough that the client takes its going as a landing, as it does the meteor's mark,
; so the column comes down on the frame the mending does.
  Height = 1
  Tint = 0xC8F27A
  Effect = MendingLight
  EffectOffset = 0
End
